---
import Tunnel from '../../../layouts/Tunnel.astro';
import Choice from '../../../components/Choice.astro';
// DRAFT
---
<Tunnel title="Drive Health Test | Save My Gig!" status="Full_Recovery">
  <div class="review-flag">DRAFT, review pending.</div>
  <div class="step-label">Step 2</div>
  <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem">Test the drive with a FULL format</h2>

  <p>A full (not quick) format writes to every cell, it's a stress test and a clean slate in one.</p>

  <ul class="checklist">
    <li>Format the USB: <span class="mono">FAT32</span> · <span class="mono">MBR</span> · <strong>uncheck Quick Format</strong>.</li>
    <li>Expect it to take a while, that's the point.</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="question">Did the full format complete normally (no errors, no absurd slowness)?</p>

  <Choice step="fr_health"
    a={{ href: '/protocol/full-recovery/rebuild', label: 'YES - CLEAN FORMAT' }}
    b={{ href: '/protocol/full-recovery/retire', label: 'NO - ERRORS OR CRAWLING', desc: 'The hardware is failing. It never gets trusted with a gig again.' }}
  />
</Tunnel>
